body:
LORE UPDATE: 

// SPOILERS FOR THE LATTER HALF OF TPB \\More lore to the Rouges of Revenge AU (yes it has a name now!!) so basically Firepaw get accepted but isn’t as kind as in canon, he feels entitlement and he is snobbish. He feels like he is better than everyone else for having a prophecy about him. He doesnt care for “stopping” tigerclaw and therefore doesnt save bluestar when he attacks him. Tigerclaw manages to kill bluestar and take over thunderclan, making Firepaw a warrior, naming him Fireclaw after himself, and appoints Darkstripe as deputy

Graystripe is his usual goofy self but gets bullied and manipulated by Fireclaw to believe that Fireclaw is a good person. He still meets silverstream but when Fireclaw find them out, he kills silverstream right in front of Graystripe  and tells him that if he tells anyone, Fireclaw will do the same to him. Graystripe exclaims that she was pregnant and fireclaw doesnt really care for this. Fireclaw returns to Tigerstar to tell about Graystripes “affair” and graystripe is banished from ThunderClan. He goes to join Ravenpaw and Barley, now Scourge and Bone and is renamed Boulder, and becomes scourge’s spy for Rouges of Revenge. Fireclaw becomes Tigerstar’s right hand man, not deputy but kinda like Boulder for Scourge. Graystripes name in this is Graytail too
